7. Add unit tests at `lib/contentstack/live-preview.test.ts` verifying: (a) `getContentstackConfig()` returns `live_preview.enable === true` with host, preview_token, and hash from env; (b) init is skipped gracefully when env vars are absent; (c) `fetchEntryWithPreview` includes the preview token header when preview mode is enabled.
8. Update `README.md` with a "Live Preview" section documenting the env vars, the Contentstack custom preview URL setup, and a known-limitation note that protected/authenticated pages are excluded from live preview scope.
9. Run the project's lint, type-check, and unit test suite to confirm the integration compiles and all new tests pass.
